// Primitive: the only reader of the raw AppPageViews table. Everything else reads this, never the table.
// PROD (la-global-nav) VERSION: this workspace's own data plus the history held in the legacy shared
// workspace (la-global-nav-dev), reached by workspace id, which survives a move. The id is kept out of the
// repo: the deploy scripts fill the placeholder from .env. A row is only ever ingested into one of the
// two, so the union never double counts. Drop the second leg once the legacy data has aged out.
union AppPageViews, workspace("__LEGACY_WORKSPACE_ID__").AppPageViews
